CORE no-new-smt
denormal.i
--arch x86_64 --os linux --floatbv
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Denormal results of x86 80-bit extended long double arithmetic, and the
transition from the denormal to the normal range.  The new SMT2 back end
(--incremental-smt2-solver) does not yet implement the byte-extract lowering
that the union accesses require.
